note PLANNED — Romit UI framework (Stage 4). Not parsed by the Stage 1 compiler.
note Counter demo: reactive state, text, and a plus button.

app CounterDemo
  screen Counter at /counter
    state
      count int is 0
    column
      padding 24
      gap 16
      align center
      text count
        size 48
        bold
      button "+"
        size 32
        on click increment
    on click increment
      set count to count plus 1
